OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACharity donates #150k to lung
OL,4,Acancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Victoria Goss, associate professor
OL,7,Fof early diagnosis and translational
OL,8,Fresearch at the Southampton Clinical
OL,9,FTrials Unit (SCTU), said: "Earlier
OL,10,Fdiagnosis can improve outcomes for
OL,11,Fpatients, but detecting lung cancer at
OL,12,Fits earliest stages can be difficult,
OL,13,Fas symptoms can be vague."
OL,15,FJon Moulton said: "We are pleased to
OL,16,Fsupport this study, which could help
OL,17,Fmore people access important screening
OL,18,Ffor lung cancer."
